# lib.cyr -- Avatara library public API
# Usage: include "avatara/src/lib.cyr"
#
# Avatara (Sanskrit: अवतार — descent of the divine)
# Divine archetype engine: theological and mythological personality
# mapping across traditions. All traditions map to the same
# ArchetypeProfile output — composable across cultures.
#
# 503 archetypes across 39 traditions.
#
# Modules:
#   types      - TraitWeights, ModuleEmphasis, ArchetypeProfile, enums
#   aspect     - universal roles derived from the trait weights (stores nothing)
#   error      - AvataraError codes, validation
#   kabbalah   - 10 Sephiroth (Tree of Life)
#   angelic    - 7 Archangels, 9 Angelic Orders
#   hindu      - 3 Trimurti, 11 Devas, 10 Avatars of Vishnu
#   olympian   - 15 Greek deities
#   norse      - 13 Aesir/Vanir gods
#   egyptian   - 16 principal deities
#   buddhist   - 7 Bodhisattvas, 5 Dhyani Buddhas
#   mesopotamian - 14 Sumerian/Babylonian deities
#   celtic     - 17 Tuatha De Danann, Insular & Continental Celtic deities
#   shinto     - 15 Japanese Kami
#   aztec      - 14 Aztec (Mexica) deities
#   maya       - 12 Maya deities
#   yoruba     - 14 Yoruba/Ifa Orishas
#   zoroastrian - 7 Amesha Spentas, 7 Zoroastrian beings
#   taoist     - 8 Immortals, 8 celestial deities
#   polynesian - 7 Hawaiian akua + 5 Maori atua (two tradition strings)
#   slavic     - 11 pre-Christian Slavic deities
#   jain       - 24 Tirthankaras
#   sikh       - 10 Sikh Gurus
#   finnish    - 13 Kalevala figures + 1 Sami goddess (tradition "Sami")
#   vodou      - 14 Vodou Lwa (Rada, Petwo, Ghede)
#   solar      - 4 intercalary archetypes (the days upon the year)
#   canaanite  - 4 Canaanite/Ugaritic deities
#   etruscan   - 4 Etruscan deities
#   incarnate  - 56 incarnate divine figures (nine tradition strings)
#   tarot      - 22 Major Arcana (Tree-of-Life paths, bridging Kabbalah)
#   iching     - 64 hexagrams (King Wen sequence, bridging the eight trigrams)
#   inuit      - 10 Arctic spirits and powers
#   lakota     - 10 wakan powers
#   haudenosaunee - 6 figures of the Six Nations creation account
#   anishinaabe - 5 manidoog of the Great Lakes
#   aboriginal - 4 figures of three Aboriginal Australian peoples
#   compose    - weighted blending of profiles
#   history    - 39 tradition-to-history mappings (civilization, era, range)
#   registry   - lookup, enumeration, query filters
#   affinity   - affinity scoring, similarity, cross-tradition matching
#   shadow     - shadow aspect: involutive inversion of a profile
#   overlay    - derived typology overlays (Enneagram, Jungian); not traditions
#   logging    - sakshi logging init

# Stdlib auto-included via cyrius.cyml

